+## 20. 5D2C10 quarantine-only post-boundary Being state materialization
+
+`bind_quarantined_spot_boundary()` now allocates fresh private native Being instances from the same validated one-boundary/two-Spot representation and hydrates their captured current fields through the existing reviewed `_Graph.native()` constructors, `BeingInstance` constructor, and the initial reconstruction adapter's field/setter path. The accepted closed instance field set covers original/current BeingDefinition references, current HP and other definition-owned fields, facing, container ID, physiology, legacy fatigue level, effective fitness, skill experience and practice baselines, possessions/weapons, spatial state, geometry, visual occlusion, Q/B physical-fatigue state, strategy and exertion. The local compatibility fingerprint and exact field inventory still gate this adapter. Unknown/missing fields or unsupported constructor values refuse.
+
+Before returning a result, the binder compares materialized HP and position with the Target candidate, current ordinary/weapon skill levels, practice baseline and experience with the complete Target practice projection, and the source Target-owned native `BatchSkillUse` and its two causal exercises with the detached historical sidecar. The represented actor skill experience is 24 (pre-boundary 17 plus the one 7-experience batch); no `record_skill_use()` call occurs. Newly constructed native Beings retain empty `skill_use_history` and have no `_atomic_target_history`; the one batch, both separate Action contributions, causal links and effect IDs remain only in the immutable sidecar.
+
+The source schema stores awareness on `Encounter.awareness`, not on `BeingInstance`. The binder cross-validates that captured mapping against both projected Target `aware_of` sets and includes each Being's detached awareness observers in its immutable current-state view. D2C11A now places the validated directed awareness mapping in a new quarantined Encounter as described in section 21. Public Being views carry frozen state snapshots and identify their role as verified quarantined post-boundary current state; historical explanations remain separately labeled. Private native references and RNG ownership remain module-private and quarantined. Source graph, module RNG, receipt registries and live simulation state remain untouched. This is still not receipt-authorized restoration or an executable/resumable Universe; all global checkpoint-readiness flags remain false, and the existing committed `reconstruct_initial_run_spot()` refusal is unchanged.
